### Treatment Plans Routes Tests
### Make sure your server is running on http://localhost:5000

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/treatment-plans
@authToken = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get all treatment plans (requires auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get treatment plans without auth (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Get treatment plan by appointment ID (requires auth)
### Replace 1 with actual appointment ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get treatment plan by non-existent appointment ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/999
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get treatment plan with invalid appointment ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/invalid
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get treatment plan by appointment ID without auth (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
